   - **判据无合法落点**：PG-1 要求把标准写入 `goal-breakdown.md`，[goal-breakdown.md:27](/Users/litianyi/Documents/Code/_ai-goods/test-harnessloop/.harnessloop/goals/20260812-003-plugin-iteration/goal-breakdown.md:27)；但 scope 只允许修改该文件的“状态列与回测结论”，而该表根本没有状态列：[scope-lock.md:36](/Users/litianyi/Documents/Code/_ai-goods/test-harnessloop/.harnessloop/goals/20260812-003-plugin-iteration/rounds/0001/scope-lock.md:36)。`goal.md` 又不在 Allowed Changes 中。
